WEBVTT

00:13:29.647 --> 00:13:31.109
It was Abraham Path Day.

00:13:31.133 --> 00:13:33.539
In São Paulo, Brazil,
it's become an annual event

00:13:33.563 --> 00:13:37.391
for thousands of people to run
in a virtual Abraham Path Run,

00:13:37.415 --> 00:13:39.186
uniting the different communities.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:42.190
The media love it; they really adore it.

00:13:42.214 --> 00:13:45.668
They lavish attention on it
because it's visual

00:13:45.692 --> 00:13:47.356
and it spreads the idea,

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:51.762
this idea of Abrahamic hospitality,
of kindness towards strangers.

00:13:51.786 --> 00:13:55.976
And just a couple weeks ago,
there was an NPR story on it.

00:13:56.589 --> 00:13:57.757
Last month,

00:13:57.781 --> 00:14:03.698
there was a piece
in the Manchester Guardian about it,